    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on an Epic Journey into the warped minds of life long gamers who are creating a nostalgic game, setting the player deep into a fantasy realm with a rich story line and many interactive features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Features Included</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sail through the seas while setting out on multiple quest lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Libraries that contain important information and stories for the player to enjoy </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merchants to provide supplies to the player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Turn based battle </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ore collection, The ore will be used for something that will be revealed in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the vast lands and unlock secret areas\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A main questline with optional Side quest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > One major choice based scenario</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple music tracks and epic sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An interactive inventory and world map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us as we unite to restore Law and Chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
